.TH "ROARK\-CUSTOMER\-FLOW\-FOLDER\-CREATE" "1" "" "roark-customer-flow-folder-create" "Roark Analytics API Manual"
.SH "NAME"
roark\-customer\-flow\-folder\-create \- Create a customer flow folder
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.B roark customer\-flow folder create
[\fIoptions\fR]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Creates a folder to group customer flows, at the top level or inside another folder with `parentId`. Folders nest up to 5 levels deep. File a flow into it by sending its `folderId` when you create or update the flow. Names are unique within their parent folder, ignoring case. Customer flows were previously called scenarios.
.SH "API"
POST /v1/customer\-flow/folder
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-name\fR \fI<value>\fR
The folder name. Must be unique within its parent folder, ignoring case. Required.
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR \fI<value>\fR
The color the folder is shown with in the app. Folders share the palette labels use. Defaults to GREY. One of: GREEN, RED, ORANGE, PURPLE, GREY, BLUE, PEACH, TEAL, INDIGO, AMBER, ROSE, CYAN. Optional.
.TP
\fB\-\-description\fR \fI<value>\fR
What belongs in this folder. Optional.
.TP
\fB\-\-parent\-id\fR \fI<value>\fR
Create the folder inside this folder. Omit it, or send null, for a top\-level folder. Optional.
.SH "GLOBAL OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-\-data\fR \fI<json>\fR
Request body as JSON, or @file to read one (@\- for stdin).
.TP
\fB\-y\fR, \fB\-\-yes\fR
Skip confirmation prompts.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-input\fR
Never prompt; fail instead.
.TP
\fB\-\-base\-url\fR \fI<url>\fR
API base URL.
.TP
\fB\-\-token\fR \fI<token>\fR
Bearer token. Prefer ROARK_API_BEARER_TOKEN or the stored credential.
.TP
\fB\-\-timeout\fR \fI<ms>\fR
Request timeout in milliseconds.
.TP
\fB\-\-max\-retries\fR \fI<count>\fR
Retries for retryable failures.
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fI<format>\fR
Output format: auto, json, jsonl, plain.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Shorthand for \-\-format json.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable colour.
.TP
\fB\-q\fR, \fB\-\-quiet\fR
Suppress non\-essential output.
.TP
